        <mxCell id="i20__2" value="The enclosing frame is the top module; the two blocks are its instances. The Gray launch register is in u_src and the n-stage synchronizer instances are in u_dst. The Gray bus crosses from u_src to u_dst on the drawn GRAY connector. Each Gray bit is a one-bit toggle through m_vlsit_afifo_cell_sync; the single-bit-change Gray property makes the multi-bit crossing safe." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;fontSize=18;fontColor=#000000;spacing=2;" vertex="1" parent="1" vlsit_library_sha256="D1631ACF98A920526B235E8970FEDDC9305EA2F0D6A35C6529CD220D62AFABB6" vlsit_library_entry="0" vlsit_library_cell="2" vlsit_library_instance="i20">
